, "text": "[ solo ]"}, {"beat": 212, "text": "Veggie lasagna, it\u2019s my passion,"}, {"beat": 220, "text": "An explosion of flavors, an invitation."}, {"beat": 228, "text": "In my kitchen, I\u2019m the star chef indeed,"}, {"beat": 236, "text": "With my veggies, fun and flavor exceed."}, {"beat": 244, "text": "[outro]"}, {"beat": 252, "text": ""}]}}}